From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:12:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: use native playback for screen-off keep-alive

Phone feedback shows app-fed PCM and downloads both stall while the wake lock remains held. Use a native MediaPlayer silent loop plus a MediaSession; record screen broadcasts, battery exemption and scheduling gaps. Shared playback files/tests are byte-identical to Anikku 0113.
